*! cleanplots2 v1.1.0 Trenton Mize 2026-10-12
*! Ordinal companion scheme to cleanplots: 2 sequential cividis colors
*
* Inherits the primary cleanplots scheme via #include. Overrides colors
* in Stata's 15 plot slots, while retaining independent line patterns
* and marker symbols. Ordered categories run from light yellow to dark navy.
*
* Color source: cividis (Nunez, Anderton, & Renslow 2018), sampled at end=.95 and direction=-1.
* Matching R scale:
*   scale_color_viridis_d(option = "cividis", end = 0.95, direction = -1)
*
* Colors recycle after 2 series when there are more than 2 plots.
* The 15 plot styles retain their own line patterns and marker symbols.
* Bar/area fills inherit cleanplots' 70 percent intensity.
*
* Example: graph bar price, over(rep78) asyvars scheme(cleanplots2)

#include cleanplots

color p1              "246 221 77"
color p1line          "246 221 77"
color p1lineplot      "246 221 77"
color p1markline      "246 221 77"
color p1bar           "246 221 77"
color p1barline       "246 221 77"
color p1area          "246 221 77"
color p1arealine      "246 221 77"
color p1pie           "246 221 77"
linepattern p1line solid
linepattern p1lineplot solid
symbol p1 smcircle

color p2              "0 32 77"
color p2line          "0 32 77"
color p2lineplot      "0 32 77"
color p2markline      "0 32 77"
color p2bar           "0 32 77"
color p2barline       "0 32 77"
color p2area          "0 32 77"
color p2arealine      "0 32 77"
color p2pie           "0 32 77"
linepattern p2line dash
linepattern p2lineplot dash
symbol p2 smsquare

color p3              "246 221 77"
color p3line          "246 221 77"
color p3lineplot      "246 221 77"
color p3markline      "246 221 77"
color p3bar           "246 221 77"
color p3barline       "246 221 77"
color p3area          "246 221 77"
color p3arealine      "246 221 77"
color p3pie           "246 221 77"
linepattern p3line shortdash
linepattern p3lineplot shortdash
symbol p3 smtriangle

color p4              "0 32 77"
color p4line          "0 32 77"
color p4lineplot      "0 32 77"
color p4markline      "0 32 77"
color p4bar           "0 32 77"
color p4barline       "0 32 77"
color p4area          "0 32 77"
color p4arealine      "0 32 77"
color p4pie           "0 32 77"
linepattern p4line longdash
linepattern p4lineplot longdash
symbol p4 smdiamond

